  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Department of Political Affairs - core funding to Multi-Year Appeal (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To ensure timely responses to situations of potential violent conflict; effective and timely support to political missions in the field; enhanced capacity of Regional and sub-Regional Organisations; strengthened UN Department of Political Affairs (DPA) capacity and expertise to address peace and security challenges more effectively; and enhanced capacity of stakeholders requesting electoral assistance to strengthen their democratic processes and prevent election-related violence</narrative>
  </description>
